easier to find. Sorbettos could also be found."]},{"k":"p","c":["Out of Bounds (XII) is one of the Arcanas in Vampire Survivors. It is unlocked by reaching the 31:00 mark in ",{"t":"Gallo Tower","r":"stage:gallo-tower"},"."]},{"k":"p","c":[{"i":"Sprite-Saint_Germain.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:saint-germain"}," ",{"t":"Saint Germain","r":"character:saint-germain"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}," starts with this Arcana."]}],"infobox":[],"sections":[{"id":"overview","title":"Overview","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["While Out of Bounds (XII) is active, freezing enemies will also summon explosions, and ",{"i":"Sprite-Orologion.png","w":24,"h":24}," Orologions are easier to find. ",{"i":"Sprite-Sorbetto.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:sorbetto"}," ",{"t":"Sorbettos","r":"weapon:sorbetto"}," also become able to be found through normal pickup sources."]},{"k":"p","c":["The explosions have a Base Damage of 10. They deal an increasing amount of damage based on time survived in a run with the formula (SecondsSurvived / 30), which translates to +2 damage every minute. The value is not quantized so the damage will increase gradually."]},{"k":"p","c":["Out of Bounds (XII) doubles the spawn weight of Orologions, effectively giving them a weight of 4. Out of Bounds (XII) also multiplies the weight of Sorbettos by 4, giving them a drop weight of 4 alongside letting them appear in light sources."]},{"k":"p","c":["This Arcana applies to the following items:"]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Clock_Lancet.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," ",{"t":"Clock Lancet","r":"weapon:clock-lancet"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Infinite_Corridor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}," ",{"t":"Infinite Corridor","r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}," (unlisted)"]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Celestial_Voulge.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:celestial-voulge"}," ",{"t":"Celestial Voulge","r":"w