},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Cocytus.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:cocytus"}," ",{"t":"Cocytus","r":"weapon:cocytus"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Hydro_Storm.png","w":22,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hydro-storm"}," ",{"t":"Hydro Storm","r":"weapon:hydro-storm"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-OdeToCastlevania.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Ode to Castlevania DLC to access"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Hydra_Cannon.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hydra-cannon"}," ",{"t":"Hydra Cannon","r":"weapon:hydra-cannon"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmeraldDiorama.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emerald Diorama DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Hyperion_Bazooka.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:hyperion-bazooka"}," ",{"t":"Hyperion Bazooka","r":"weapon:hyperion-bazooka"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmeraldDiorama.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emerald Diorama DLC to access"}]},{"c":[{"i":"Sprite-Spirit_Rings.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}," ",{"t":"Spirit Rings","r":"weapon:spirit-rings"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmeraldDiorama.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emerald Diorama DLC to access"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Rings_of_Calamity.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:rings-of-calamity"}," ",{"t":"Rings of Calamity","r":"weapon:rings-of-calamity"}," ",{"i":"Sprite-DLCBadge-EmeraldDiorama.png","w":12,"h":12,"a":"This content requires the Emerald Diorama DLC to access"}]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"tips","title":"Tips","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["This Arcana pairs excellently with ",{"i":"Sprite-Jail_of_Crystal_(XIV).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:jail-of-crystal-xiv"}," ",{"t":"Jail of Crystal (XIV)","r":"arcana:jail-of-crystal-xiv"},", as it allows more weapons to freeze enemies and trigger cold explosions."]},{"c":["This Arcana also synergizes very well with ",{"i":"Sprite-Crystal_Cries_(XII).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"}," ",{"t":"Crystal Cries (XII)","r":"arcana:crystal-cries-xii"},", which causes defeated frozen enemies to drop ",{"i":"Sprite-Crystallized_Soul.png","w":24,"h":23}," Crystallized Souls that boost ",{"i":"Sprite-Growth.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:growth"}," ",{"t":"Growth","r":"powerup:growth"},", ",{"i":"Sprite-Recovery.png","w":24,"h":21,"r":"powerup:recovery"}," ",{"t":"Recovery","r":"powerup:recovery"},", and ",{"i":"Sprite-Max_Health.png","w":24,"h":23,"r":"powerup:max-health"}," ",{"t":"Max Health","r":"powerup:max-health"}," when collected."]},{"c":["If ",{"i":"Sprite-The_Reaper.png","w":20,"h":24}," The Reaper is defeated with ",{"i":"Sprite-Infinite_Corridor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}," ",{"t":"Infinite Corridor","r":"weapon:infinite-corridor"}," or ",{"i":"Sprite-Crimson_Shroud.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}," ",{"t":"Crimson Shroud","r":"weapon:crimson-shroud"}," prior to 31:00, Out of Bounds (XII) can still be unlocked as the timer will automatically be set to 31:00 during the ",{"i":"Sprite-White_Hand.png","w":15,"h":16}," White Hand sequence."]}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"update-history","title":"Update history","blocks":[{"k":"p","c":["This information has been manually compiled. Some updates may not be included yet."]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 17 August 2023 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed error where Cold Explosions were triggering on already dead targets."]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 7 July 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Fixed \"Reach minute 31\" arcanas not unlocking under certain situations"]}]}}]},{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["update 23 May 2022 (Update):"],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["Added to game."]}]}}]}],"subs":[]},{"id":"trivia","title":"Trivia","blocks":[{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["The name of this Arcana is a reference to the song \"",{"t":"Out of Time","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Out_of_Time"},"\", which is the theme song of the ",{"t":"Clock Tower","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania_Block_6"}," in ",{"t":"Castlevania","x":"https://castlevania.fandom.com/wiki/Castlevania_(video_game)"},"."]},{"c":["Out of Bounds (XII) can be unlocked in the ",{"i":"Sprite-Forbidden_Scrolls_of_Morbane.png","w":16,"h":16,"r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," ",{"t":"Forbidden Scrolls of Morbane","r":"relic:forbidden-scrolls-of-morbane"}," by casting the spell \"lappeso\", which means \"the hanged man\" in Italian."],"sub":{"k":"ul","items":[{"c":["This makes Out of Bounds (XII) a representation of ",{"t":"The Hanged Man","x":"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/The_Hanged_Man_(tarot_card)"}," Major Arcana card, symbolizing pause, suspense, surrender, indecision, self-sacrifice, and contemplation."]},{"c":["This is reflected in its ability to make freezing pickups more common, as well as creating explosions upon freezing enemies that has damage scaled around time."]}]}},{"c":["Out of Bounds' original name was Out of Time. This fits it affecting Clock Lancet and Orologions, along with dealing more damage based on time."]},{"c":["Out of Bounds refers to how the coffin of ",{"i":"Sprite-Concetta_Caciotta.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"character:concetta-caciotta"}," ",{"t":"Concetta Caciotta","r":"character:concetta-caciotta"}," is not within the Gallo Tower itself, and requires a teleporting mirror to enter the room with it."]},{"c":["The explosions as a standalone weapon creates an explosion at the player character. It can also be affected by ",{"i":"Sprite-Amount.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:amount"}," ",{"t":"Amount","r":"powerup:amount"}," and ",{"i":"Sprite-Cooldown.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:cooldown"}," ",{"t":"Cooldown","r":"powerup:cooldown"},", which is not the case when it is an Arcana effect as they always explode only once."]},{"c":["There used to be an oversight where the cold explosions will also benefit from ",{"i":"Sprite-Armor.png","w":24,"h":24,"r":"powerup:armor-stat"}," ",{"t":"Armor","r":"powerup:armor-stat"},", likely due to copying the code from ",{"i":"Sprite-Heart_of_Fire_(XIX).png","w":17,"h":24,"r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"}," ",{"t":"Heart of Fire (XIX)","r":"weapon:heart-of-fire-xix"},"'s explosions. This has been fixed in patch 0.11.0."]}]}],"subs":[]}]}